{"type":"message","id":"6853e3f2","parentId":"1a67382d","timestamp":"2026-04-14T03:54:09.936Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-14 03:54:07 UTC] Feishu[default] group oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52efeb2fc488c2c4318dfa15bca, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52efeb2fc488c2c4318dfa15bca\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-14 03:54 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 1\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1776138608209,\n    \"body\": \"晁留柱: 集团组建了不龙虾沟通群,ID:oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8,请你以我的租户身份(但是要在信息里标注你的昵称),给各位研发伙伴发一个早上咱们的德胧内部龙虾落地实践的报告,同时表达我们会加油努力,要谦虚.可以带表情、带一张龙虾努力工作的图片.@Arkclaw_云\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n你可以调用minimax的生图能力,生成一张卡通的,龙虾在搞德胧AI native的图片,以我的租户身份发送到集团小龙虾沟通群,ID:oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8,"}],"timestamp":1776138849888}}
