{"type":"message","id":"9bb0ffc7","parentId":"57f48487","timestamp":"2026-04-14T03:55:25.154Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"飞书上传图片比较麻烦。让我尝试用 feishu_im_bot_image 工具或者其他方式。先试试把图片先转成base64。\n\n或者我可以用 feishu_drive_file upload 先上传到云盘，然后再发送。\n\n但这些都比较复杂。让我试试更简单的方式——先用web_fetch的方式看看图片URL能不能直接用。\n\n算了，我直接用feishu的工具上传。先研究一下正确的上传方式。\n\n飞书上图片需要先上传到im/v1/images接口获取image_key，然后用这个key发送。\n\n让我尝试通过文档方式处理。或者直接让用户手动发也不是不行，但用户要求我发。\n\n让我试着用curl方式上传。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o8zzhrcys95u_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"app_id\":\"'\"$FEISHU_APP_ID\"'\",\"app_secret\":\"'\"$FEISHU_APP_SECRET\"'\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776138916658,"responseId":"062ceda4fb3b565dec539760eb1ea170"}}
