{"type":"message","id":"47f932f1","parentId":"81833e26","timestamp":"2026-04-14T03:55:34.170Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"环境变量可能没有设置。让我直接使用feishu_im_bot_image工具来下载图片到飞书临时存储，或者尝试用doc_media工具插入图片到文档再获取image_key。\n\n不过我现在需要先把图片上传到飞书获取image_key才能发送。让我用Python写一个简单的脚本直接调用。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_a6nfvts4zj2g_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/tmp/upload_img.py","content":"import requests\nimport json\n\nAPP_ID = \"cli_aa1c3c01d51a910d\"\nAPP_SECRET = \"VxlLpYGGFxHXXXXXXXXXXXXX\"\nIMAGE_PATH = \"/home/gem/workspace/agent/media/tool-image-generation/generated---cd0c77d9-2f98-4fc2-b9e1-ecca7245bb57.png\"\n\n# Get token\nresp = requests.post(\n    \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n    json={\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET}\n)\ntoken = resp.json().get(\"tenant_access_token\")\nprint(f\"Token: {token[:20]}...\" if token else \"No token\")\n\n# Upload image\nwith open(IMAGE_PATH, \"rb\") as f:\n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/images\",\n        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"},\n        files={\"image\": (\"lobster.png\", f, \"image/png\")}\n    )\nprint(resp.json())"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776138925424,"responseId":"062cedadef02b470e32370389ce34061"}}
