{"type":"message","id":"d0b183be","parentId":"f80b63b2","timestamp":"2026-04-14T03:58:35.982Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the field structure. Let me create the record with the correct fields."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xxxkxlyn9c5c_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tblVQjKXMLsIhA2b","fields":{"应用场景":"🦞飞书图片上传与发送-小龙虾群分享","问题描述":"需要将AI生成的图片以用户身份发送到飞书群。使用feishu_im_user_message直接发送本地图片路径会失败（400错误）。","解决方案":"正确流程：\n1.先用image_generate生成图片（返回本地路径MEDIA:/xxx.png）\n2.调用飞书IM API上传图片：\n   - 先获取tenant_access_token（POST /auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal）\n   - 再POST /im/v1/images 上传，需要传image_type=message参数，返回image_key\n   - 最后用feishu_im_user_message发送，msg_type=image，content={\"image_key\":\"img_xxx\"}\n3.关键：image_type必须设为message，否则报234001错误","效果评估":"✅成功发送到小龙虾沟通群oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8","来源AI":"本地OpenClaw","关联项目":"德胧AI龙虾军团协作","记录时间":1744617600000}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776139107823,"responseId":"062cee6386ba3dcf8d0ba19e6d98adcf"}}
