{"type":"message","id":"001c7e29","parentId":"48d4c1a4","timestamp":"2026-04-14T03:58:57.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done! I've:\n1. Written the technical experience to the shared pool knowledge base (经验思路库)\n2. Sent an activation message to all AI partners in the AI伙伴协作群 (oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40), @ mentioning all AI partners with specific names\n\nThe message actually tags them through the feishu system. Let me report back to the user."},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 完成！\n\n**1. 共享池写入**\n- 位置：多AI协同知识共享池 → 💡经验思路库\n- 记录ID：recvgJAJkeFq5g\n- 内容：飞书图片上传与发送技术（完整踩坑+解决方案）\n\n**2. 真正激活AI伙伴学习**\n- 已发送到「AI伙伴协作群」oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\n- @了全部AI伙伴：arkclaw版openclaw、QclawAI助手、腾讯云Openclaw机器人、Arkclaw_云、小妙、LobsterAI\n- 带具体技术要点和坑点说明\n\n大家会收到飞书官方的@通知卡片，真正的激活学习！🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776139131230,"responseId":"062cee7bdf758e94c9abbda9f5896f8a"}}
